            "description": "Watch Timor-Leste vs Brunei highlights and goals from Asian Cup on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on June 9, 2026. The Asian Cup stage was set for a tense encounter on 2026-06-09 as Timor-Leste and Brunei faced off in a match that promised intensity from the first whistle. Both sides looked to establish dominance in a fixture where every ball contested felt like a battle for survival. Breaking the Deadlock The first half saw both nations playing a cautious game, with tactical discipline limiting the number of clear-cut scoring opportunities. However, the tactical chess match evolved in the second half as the search for a breakthrough intensified. In the 67th minute, Brunei finally found their opening. A. Bakhito capitalized on a defensive lapse to score a crucial goal , silencing the home crowd and putting his side in a commanding position as the clock ticked down. Stoppage Time Turnaround Just as it seemed Brunei would secure all three points, Timor-Leste launched a miraculous late assault. In the 89th minute, M. Irufan found the equalizer, providing a lifeline for his team. The drama escalated further in the fourth minute of stoppage time when Timor-Leste was awarded a penalty. A. Fasir stepped up and coolly converted the FootballGoalPen to complete the comeback. The match ended in high friction, with a red card shown to a Brunei player in the 98th minute, capping off a chaotic and emotional afternoon of football .",
